    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha kwa ng'wa Saala",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu būlamu bokwe ū Saala, akashisha myaka igana na makūmi abīlī na mpungatī (127); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna ūcha, balī Kiliati-alaba (h'ī Hebuloni) mu sī ya Kanaani; ū Abulahamu akalīla no, alīnīla ū Saala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma y'ikanza ū Abulahamu ūbūūka, wīnga aho wanīlīlaga ū nke, ūūkahooya na Bahītī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bahītī:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bitūnja ba ng'wa Heti (Lola na Ng'hī. 5,7,10,16,18 na 20).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya, “Ū nene nalī nshimīzi, nizile kwikala mu sī ying'we; nijingījagi ipandī lya sī a henaha, napandīke ha kūnjīka ū nke wane ūyo wazumalīkaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bahītī būnshokeja ū Abulahamu gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Baba tūdegelekage; gīkī ū bebe ūlī munhū ntaale no ū mu bise, ū ng'wenūmu tūlī na mapandī gise gawiza no, ūmo tūkajīkīlaga; njīkage dūhū ng'wenūmo ū munhū wako. Atīho nūūlū ūmò ū mu bise wa kūkwima ipandī lya kūjīkīla, nūūlū wa kūkūlemeja ūtizūnjīka ū munhū wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abulahamu ūbūūka, winama n'ikūjo ū kū būtongi wa banhū ba mu sī yenīyo, a Bahītī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla, “Ūlū mulīzunya nanjīke ū munhū wane, nidegelekagi. A bing'we nilombelagi ū kūlī Efuloni, ū ng'wana Zohali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anijingīje ī lipilinga lyakwe ī lya Makipela, īlo līlī kū mhelo y'ilaale lyakwe. Nīyo anijingīje mu mpango gwalyo gete ūmo gūlī, nane nabize n'ipandī ū mu bing'we, lyane nane lya kūyūjīkīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Efuloni ū Ng'hītī, nang'hwe walī igashije hamò nabo a banhū ba lūganda lwakwe; hūna ūnshokeja ū Abulahamu, badegelekile pye a Bahītī abo baalī biza a ha mita gwa nzengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya gīkī, “Ali lūūlū baba, niigwage gete; nalīkwinha ī lilaale nī lipilinga īlo līlīmo, nalīkwinha mu būtongi wa banhū bane aba; njīkage ū munhū wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Abulahamu winama hangī ū kū būtongi wa banhū ba sī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla ū Efuloni, pye badegelekile; ūhaya gīkī, “Baba niigwage, ūlū ūlīzunya, ū nene nakwinhe ī sabo ya kūlenganīla nū mpango gwalyo ī lilaale lyenīlo; anukūlaga naje nakanjīke ū munhū wane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Efuloni ūnshokeja ū Abulahamu alīhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Baba nidegelekage; ū mpango gw'ilaale gūlī shekeli magana anè ja feza, ī shenīsho nasho shikolo kī a ha gatī yako nū nene? Solaga baba ūnjīke ū nyagi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nyagi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Munhū ūyo azumalīkile, nūūlū mfu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abulahamu ūgūzunya ū mpango gwa ng'wa Efuloni, ūmpimīla ū būdito wa sabo īyo akīhaya; ūng'winha kū būtongi wa Bahītī. Jalī shekeli magana anè ja feza, kūlenganīla nū būdito ūbo botūmamīlagwa na basūlūja ū mu shikū jenījo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī lilaale lya ng'wa Efuloni īlo lyalī Makipela ya Mamule, lyūlolwa chiza ī mbīmbī jalyo ūmo jalī jigelelile; ī lilaale lyenekīlī lyūmanīka, nī lipilinga īlo lyalīmo, pyī nī mitī īyo yalī īzwile moi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lyūtūūlwa mu makono ga ng'wa Abulahamu, kū būtongi wa Bahītī, pye abo baalī biza a ha mita gwa nzengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Abulahamu ūnjīka ū nke wakwe ū Saala, ū ng'wipilinga īlo lyalī ng'wilaale lya Makipela hihī na Mamule (ya Hebuloni) mu sī ya Kanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bahītī būbiza balītūūla mu makono ga ng'wa Abulahamu ī lilaale lyenīlo nī lipilinga lyamo, lībize ipandī lyakwe lya kūjīkīla banhū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
